       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for ibuprofen in adults is 3,200 mg/day, so this is double that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Those risks apply even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nWas one of these intended?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily:** 3,200 mg/day, the maximum for anti-inflammatory dosing.\n- **800 mg by mouth, three times daily:** 2,400 mg/day, a common dose.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, every 6 hours:** for analgesia.\n- **1600 mg total per day, divided:** for example, 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you really do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first, and I'd add a note documenting the rationale."
